{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bottom-screen idle game that won't disrupt your work or study. Research tech, farm crops, raise animals, recruit survivors, unlock mines, hunt mutants, fend off aberrations, gear up your squad, craft with machinery, repair the rocket, build your shelter\u2014and conquer the apocalypse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Crops</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign planting tasks to your shelter survivors. They'll autonomously work\u2014gathering wild plants, sowing, watering, fertilizing, and reaping bountiful harvests!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/fc1ddbedb4b72d787e66339dd80e6415.poster.avif?t=1770399181\" width=766 height=148 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/fc1ddbedb4b72d787e66339dd80e6415.webm?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/fc1ddbedb4b72d787e66339dd80e6415.mp4?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors assigned to ranching will automatically fetch tools from the storage, capture animals, raise them, provide feed, and eventually yield raw meat and other materials!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3b9a36d2620ea27b191a3c58e1a60db0.poster.avif?t=1770399181\" width=712 height=158 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3b9a36d2620ea27b191a3c58e1a60db0.webm?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/3b9a36d2620ea27b191a3c58e1a60db0.mp4?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Machinery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a dozen unique mechanical devices. Power your grid, fuel your machines. Forge the ultimate shelter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/016cb9e86d84e620217ba643ea1005c4.poster.avif?t=1770399181\" width=714 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/016cb9e86d84e620217ba643ea1005c4.webm?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/016cb9e86d84e620217ba643ea1005c4.mp4?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fighting!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft Your Arsenal. Equip for Battle. Conquer Mutants and Monstrous Bosses! The Hunt is On!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/f316636129d91f5c95bdc8f7cd8b81aa.poster.avif?t=1770399181\" width=714 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/f316636129d91f5c95bdc8f7cd8b81aa.webm?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617390/extras/f316636129d91f5c95bdc8f7cd8b81aa.mp4?t=1770399181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p c